Package: aic8800fdrvpackage
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.8), build-essential, kmod, udev, eject
Recommends: mokutil
Maintainer: aic
Description: AIC8800 USB WiFi driver with DKMS support
 Builds AIC8800 modules for the host kernel and rebuilds them on kernel updates.
 Matching prepared kernel headers are required. Use the accompanying installer
 to download dependencies and headers automatically on Debian/Ubuntu systems.
